          "source_quote": "Διατί οὖν, φημί, κύριε, αἱ παρθένοι καὶ τούτους τοὺς λίθους ἐπέδωκαν εἰς τὴν οἰκοδομὴν τοῦ πύργου, διενέγκασαι διὰ τῆς πύλης;",
          "english_quote": "“Then why, sir,” I said, “did the virgins carry these stones through the gate and hand them over for building the tower?”",
          "issue": "The simplified question omits the additive emphasis of καὶ τούτους: these stones too were handed over by the virgins. Merely saying “these stones” identifies the group but does not preserve its inclusion alongside other stones. The standard edition retains this distinction with “also.”",
          "suggested_revision": "Proposed for fresh review: “Then why, sir,” I said, “did the virgins carry these stones too through the gate and hand them over for building the tower?”",
